 "text": "Treasurer\nWelcome to the Ziebach County Website!\nHome\nOFFICES\nAssessor\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nZIEBACH COUNTY 4H\nNURSE\nEMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSHERIFF\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVOTER INFORMATION\nMore\nHome\nOFFICES Assessor\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nZIEBACH COUNTY 4H\nNURSE\nEMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSHERIFF\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVOTER INFORMATION\nHome\nOFFICES Assessor\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nZIEBACH COUNTY 4H\nNURSE\nEMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSHERIFF\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVOTER INFORMATION\nZiebach County, SD\nZiebach County, SD Ziebach County, SD Ziebach County, SD\nWelcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website\nWelcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website Welcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website Welcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website\nTreasurer\nTreasurer\nThe Treasurer is the collector of taxes and has the duty to receive all money belonging to the county from whatever source (taxes, drivers license, etc.) The Treasurer maintains accounting records and is responsible for county fund investment. The Treasurer and Auditor work in conjunction to pay county bills. The county Treasurer is responsible for issuing motor vehicle registration and drivers licenses along with reporting the to the SD Department of Motor Vehicles.\nLicense Fees (Beginning July 1st)\nFees for MOTOR VEHICLE licensing\nDrivers license\n$38\nFor operators drivers license\nCommercial drivers license (CDL)\n$43\nFor regular commercial drivers license - no endorsements\nLEARNERS PERMIT DRIVERS LICENSE\n$38\nFor 14-17 year old learners permit - knowledge test\nLEARNERS PERMIT DRIVERS LICENSE\n$38\nFor 14-17 year old learners permit - driving test\nFor more questions, please call 605-365-5173\nCopyright © 2026 Ziebach County - All Rights Reserved.\nPowered by",
